> Dan D.

You need a copy of Dehacked (infant2) to use them. If you have it, 
then all you have to do is put it and the .deh files in the same 
directory as doom.exe and type dehacked -load whatever.deh.
 This procedure will modify the doom.exe file, so make a backup,
just in case of an error. Try the suprwepn.deh, you'll never
leave home without it again. 8=)

